{"symbol":"PRODEA.AT","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T18:33:38Z","info":{"address1":"Chrisospiliotissis 9","city":"Athina","zip":"105 60","country":"Greece","phone":"213 3334000","fax":"213 3334304","website":"https://www.prodea.gr","industry":"REIT - Office","industryKey":"reit-office","industryDisp":"REIT - Office","sector":"Real Estate","sectorKey":"real-estate","sectorDisp":"Real Estate","longBusinessSummary":"Prodea Real Estate Investment Company Société Anonyme is the largest real estate investment company in Greece, listed on the Athens Stock Exchange (ATHEX). It engages in the acquisition and management of real estate assets in the best-performing sectors of the region, such as high-end hospitality, logistics, and green office spaces, with selective placements in the residential market. PRODEA maintains a well-balanced and diversified asset exposure in key locations across Greece and Cyprus, along with selective positioning in other significant markets in Southeastern Europe, including Italy. Its portfolio is expertly managed by seasoned professionals to ensure strategic growth and value creation. Committed to leading innovation across all sectors in which it operates, PRODEA Investments delivers high-quality assets and services to its clientele within a sustainable framework. The company is headquartered in Athens, Greece. Prodea Real Estate Investment Company Société Anonyme is a subsidiary of Invel Real Estate (Netherlands) II B.V.","fullTimeEmployees":34,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Christophoros Nikolaos Papachristophorou","age":55,"title":"Executive Chairman of the Board of Directors","yearBorn":1970,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Aristotelis Dimitrios Karytinos","age":69,"title":"Executive Vice Chairman of the Board of Directors & CEO","yearBorn":1956,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Theresia Gerasimos Messari","title":"CFO, COO, Head of Investor Relations & Public R